00:45:30.090 --> 00:45:31.270
Too soon to suit me.

00:45:31.850 --> 00:45:32.770
You better let me take that.

00:45:45.960 --> 00:45:47.320
Quick claim to the Purnace Ranch.

00:45:48.260 --> 00:45:49.080
What is this, a joke?

00:45:50.660 --> 00:45:51.620
Does this look like we're joking?

00:45:53.800 --> 00:45:54.640
Just who are you, anyway?

00:45:55.560 --> 00:45:56.580
if it makes any difference.

