There it is, but it won't stand in court.

00:47:02.530 --> 00:47:04.170
We'll take a chance on that. Just sign it.

00:47:05.670 --> 00:47:07.420
Boy, that sounds like you.

00:47:08.190 --> 00:47:24.240
I'll stand in court, all right.

