What did I tell you?

00:49:00.820 --> 00:49:02.420
There's Sloan fighting beside McCall.

00:49:02.620 --> 00:49:03.880
They got somebody cornered.

00:49:23.450 --> 00:49:24.310
I was going to say, I...

00:49:24.620 --> 00:49:25.940
Here's this, my fella, who was there?

00:50:46.730 --> 00:50:48.890
Ken Sloan or Rogers, whatever you want to call him.

00:50:49.350 --> 00:50:50.050
You killed him.

00:50:51.050 --> 00:50:51.770
Nice shooting, mister.

00:50:52.520 --> 00:50:52.840
Thanks.

